<title>ITALY: Italmobiliare seeks rest of Franco Tosi.</title>
<headline>Italmobiliare seeks rest of Franco Tosi.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Italmobiliare SpA is to launch a public offer for all outstanding shares of industrial holding company Franco Tosi SpA that it does not already own.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it was offering 17,000 lire each for 9,451,125 shares for a total value of 160.669 billion lire.</p>
<p>The offer was conditional on obtaining acceptance of the offer for at least 6,930,954 shares, equivalent to 27.5 percent of the company's capital.</p>
